    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Hanley are pleased to bring to the market this traditional stone cottage, situated on an elevated site in a peaceful rural setting approximately 4km from Ballyhaunis.\n\nA particular feature of this property is the opportunity to acquire a substantial additional holding of land surrounding the cottage. A further c. 66 acres of adjoining agricultural land is available to purchase separately, offering purchasers the flexibility to create a larger holding.\n\nLocation & Connectivity\n\nDespite its private rural setting, the property is conveniently located approximately 4km from Ballyhaunis and 17km from Claremorris, with easy access to the N60 providing direct regional connectivity towards Castlebar, Claremorris and Roscommon.\n\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your \"mySherryFitz\" account.\n\nThe property is being offered for sale \"as is” and without the benefit of planning permission**. Any potential purchaser considering the restoration, renovation, replacement or redevelopment of the existing structure should satisfy themselves as to the condition of the property and the feasibility of their intended use, including any planning permission or other consents that may be required. There is no septic tank on site."
      },
